        <part lastModifyTime="0" updateMethod="0">
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="1">
                <start-time>00:00:03,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:05,180</end-time>
                <translation>君主为了保卫国家</translation>
                <original>君主は国を守るため</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="2">
                <start-time>00:00:05,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:08,560</end-time>
                <translation>应该如何抓住人心并采取行动</translation>
                <original>いかに人の心をつかみ行動すべきか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="3">
                <start-time>00:00:11,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:14,380</end-time>
                <translation>16世纪佛罗伦萨的外交官马基雅维利</translation>
                <original>16世紀フィレンツェの外交官マキャベリは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="4">
                <start-time>00:00:14,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:17,260</end-time>
                <translation>在《君主论》中阐述了其中的诀窍</translation>
                <original>君主論の中でその極意を説きました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="5">
                <start-time>00:00:20,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:25,175</end-time>
                <translation>无论哪个时代 人际关系面临的困难都不会改变</translation>
                <original>いつの時代も人間関係の難しさは変わりません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="6">
                <start-time>00:00:25,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:29,680</end-time>
                <translation>《君主论》也能给现代的我们带来启示</translation>
                <original>君主論は現代の私たちにもヒントを与えてくれるのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="7">
                <start-time>00:00:32,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:36,525</end-time>
                <translation>100分de名著《君主论》</translation>
                <original>100分de名著君主論</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="8">
                <start-time>00:00:36,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:42,900</end-time>
                <translation>主讲人是曾翻译《马基雅维利全集》的武田好女士
指南役はマキャベリ全集の翻訳を手掛けた武田好さん</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="9">
                <start-time>00:00:42,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:47,575</end-time>
                <translation>本期将解读马基雅维利的人心掌控术</translation>
                <original>マキャベリの人心掌握術を読み解きます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="10">
                <start-time>00:00:47,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:51,334</end-time>
                <translation>君主应当主动承担施恩的角色
君主は恩恵を与える役は進んで引き受け</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="11">
                <start-time>00:00:51,334</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:56,350</end-time>
                <translation>招人憎恨的角色 让其他人去承担就好</translation>
                <original>憎まれ役は他人に受け終わせればいい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="12">
                <start-time>00:00:56,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:59,725</end-time>
                <translation>啊——这又让人蛮有心机的呢</translation>
                <original>はぁーこれはまたあざとさを感じるけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="13">
                <start-time>00:00:59,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:01,540</end-time>
                <translation>从马基雅维利的《君主论》中学习</translation>
                <original>マキャベリの君主論に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="14">
                <start-time>00:01:01,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:04,120</end-time>
                <translation>在时代中生存的智慧</translation>
                <original>時代を生き抜く知恵を学びます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="15">
                <start-time>00:01:29,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:36,646</end-time>
                <translation>第3回 人际关系的极意
第3回　人間関係の極意</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="16">
                <start-time>00:01:38,940</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:41,100</end-time>
                <translation>虽然每个人都曾想过要读一次</translation>
                <original>誰もが一度は読んでみたいと思いながらも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="17">
                <start-time>00:01:41,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:43,325</end-time>
                <translation>却一直难以拿起来阅读的名著</translation>
                <original>なかなか手に取ることのできない名著を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="18">
                <start-time>00:01:43,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:46,180</end-time>
                <translation>用25分钟一集、共4集 也就是100分钟来通俗易懂地解读</translation>
                <original>25分かける4回つまり100分で分かりやすく読み解く</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="19">
                <start-time>00:01:46,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:47,940</end-time>
                <translation>100分钟名著 我是堀尾正明
100分de名著堀尾正明です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="20">
                <start-time>00:01:47,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:49,150</end-time>
                <translation>我是瀧口友里奈
瀧口友里奈です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="21">
                <start-time>00:01:49,159</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:52,650</end-time>
                <translation>那么 这次我们解读的是马基雅维利的《君主论》</translation>
                <original>さあ今回読み解いているのはマキャベリの君主論ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="22">
                <start-time>00:01:52,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:56,875</end-time>
                <translation>上一回 也就是第2回 我们探讨了理想的领导者形象</translation>
                <original>前回2回目は理想のリーダー像を見てまいりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="23">
                <start-time>00:01:56,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:58,968</end-time>
                <translation>领导者有时需要冷酷</translation>
                <original>リーダーは時に冷淡である</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="24">
                <start-time>00:01:58,968</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:01,450</end-time>
                <translation>光靠太温柔是不行的</translation>
                <original>あんまり優しいペントじゃダメなんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="25">
                <start-time>00:02:01,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:04,160</end-time>
                <translation>我们学到了不动摇的勇气也是必要的</translation>
                <original>ブレない勇気も必要だということを学びましたね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="26">
                <start-time>00:02:04,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:06,409</end-time>
                <translation>是的 治理国家这件事</translation>
                <original>はいもう国を治めるということは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="27">
                <start-time>00:02:06,409</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:10,075</end-time>
                <translation>我们明白了它是相当复杂且辛苦的</translation>
                <original>かなり複雑で大変なことだということが分かりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="28">
                <start-time>00:02:10,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:13,600</end-time>
                <translation>那么第3回 我们将以“人际关系的诀窍”
で第3回は人間関係の極意と</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="29">
                <start-time>00:02:13,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:15,175</end-time>
                <translation>为题为大家呈现</translation>
                <original>タイトルでお届けしたいと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="30">
                <start-time>00:02:15,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:19,000</end-time>
                <translation>国家之间的关系 或是自己的部下和民众</translation>
                <original>国同士の関係あるいは自身の部下とかぎょうみん</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="31">
                <start-time>00:02:19,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:21,625</end-time>
                <translation>马基雅维利独有的人心掌控</translation>
                <original>マキャベリならではの人身掌握</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="32">
                <start-time>00:02:21,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:22,959</end-time>
                <translation>通过了解这些</translation>
                <original>これを見ることによって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="33">
                <start-time>00:02:22,959</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:25,400</end-time>
                <translation>我们也能思考到底该如何抓住人心</translation>
                <original>我々もやっぱり人の心をつかみにはどうしたらいいのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="34">
                <start-time>00:02:25,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:27,840</end-time>
                <translation>如果是泷口先生的话 要如何抓住男人的心呢</translation>
                <original>瀧口さんだったら男性の心をつかみにはどうしたらいいのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="35">
                <start-time>00:02:27,840</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:29,075</end-time>
                <translation>也许连那种事都能明白</translation>
                <original>そんなことまで分かるかもしれない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="36">
                <start-time>00:02:29,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:32,250</end-time>
                <translation>是的 能明白吗？毕竟这是掌控人心的技巧嘛</translation>
                <original>はい分かりますかね人身掌握術ですもんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="37">
                <start-time>00:02:32,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:34,460</end-time>
                <translation>我非常期待</translation>
                <original>ぜひ楽しみにしたいと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="38">
                <start-time>00:02:34,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:37,400</end-time>
