            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="44">
                <start-time>00:02:57,435</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:00,850</end-time>
                <translation>当时16世纪的意大利正处于战乱之中</translation>
                <original>当時16世紀のイタリアというのは戦乱の世の中ということで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" id="" time="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0" index="45">
                <start-time>00:03:00,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:02,565</end-time>
                <translation>果然比和平时期更加</translation>
                <original>やっぱり平和の時以上に</original>
